  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 1402.04 Construction",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1402.04 “Construction” means, for the purpose of RSA 483-B:5-b, I(a):\n\n(a) The erection, demolition, reconstruction, or alteration of any structure; or\n\n(b) Any activity that results in an increase in the impervious surface area on a property.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1 and #2 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1400) #12062 eff 12-17-16",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wq1400.html"
